                                        <div class="tab-pane fade active show" id="pills-1" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="Introduction"><p>The School of Computer and Information Sciences (SOCIS) at Indira Gandhi National Open University (IGNOU), New Delhi, is a prominent academic division dedicated to advancing education and research in the rapidly evolving fields of computer science and information technology. Established in the year 1991 as part of IGNOU's commitment to democratizing education, SOCIS aims to provide high-quality, accessible, and cost-effective programs for learners across diverse socio-economic backgrounds.</p></div>

                                        
                                    </div>
                                    <div>
                                        

                                        <div class="tab-pane fade" id="pills-2" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="Aboutus"  ><section class="socis-key-features" style="font-size:15px; line-height:1.6; text-align:justify;">

    <h2 style="font-size:20px; text-align:left; margin:0 0 15px 0;">
        Key Features
    </h2>

    <h3 style="font-size:17px; text-align:left; margin:18px 0 6px 0;">
          <strong> Academic Excellence</strong>
    </h3>
    <p style="margin:0 0 12px 0;">
        SOCIS offers a variety of programmes ranging from certificate to doctoral
        levels, designed to meet the needs of learners, working professionals, and
        researchers. The courses emphasise both theoretical foundations and
        practical applications in computer science.
    </p>

    <h3 style="font-size:17px; text-align:left; margin:18px 0 6px 0;">
          <strong> Innovative Curriculum</strong>
    </h3>
    <p style="margin:0 0 12px 0;">
        Programmes are regularly updated to reflect the latest advancements in
        technology, covering areas such as data science, artificial intelligence,
        cloud computing, and more.
    </p>

    <h3 style="font-size:17px; text-align:left; margin:18px 0 6px 0;">
           <strong>Flexible Learning</strong>
    </h3>
    <p style="margin:0 0 12px 0;">
        True to IGNOU's Open and Distance Learning (ODL) model, SOCIS provides
        flexible study options, enabling learners to learn at their own pace while
        balancing personal and professional commitments.
    </p>

    <h3 style="font-size:17px; text-align:left; margin:18px 0 8px 0;">
          <strong> Programmes Offered</strong>
    </h3>

    <ul style="margin:0 0 15px 20px; padding-left:18px; text-align:left;">
        <li style="margin-bottom:6px;">
            <strong>Doctoral Research Programme</strong>
            <ul style="margin-top:5px; padding-left:20px;">
                <li>Ph.D. in regular mode</li>
            </ul>
        </li>

        <li style="margin-bottom:6px;">
            <strong>Master's Degrees</strong>
            <ul style="margin-top:5px; padding-left:20px;">
                <li>
                    Master of Computer Applications (MCA) – ODL and Online modes
                </li>
                <li>
                    M.Sc. (Data Science and Analytics) (MSCDSA) – ODL mode
                </li>
                <li>
                    M.Sc. (Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning) (MSCAIML) –
                    ODL mode
                </li>
            </ul>
        </li>

        <li style="margin-bottom:6px;">
            <strong>Bachelor's Degree</strong>
            <ul style="margin-top:5px; padding-left:20px;">
                <li>
                    Bachelor of Computer Applications (BCA) – ODL and Online modes
                </li>
            </ul>
        </li>

        <li style="margin-bottom:6px;">
            <strong>Postgraduate Diploma in Computer Applications (PGDCA_NEW) – ODL mode</strong>
        </li>

        <li style="margin-bottom:6px;">
             <strong>Certificate in Information Technology (CIT) – ODL and Online modes</strong>
        </li>

        <li style="margin-bottom:6px;">
            <strong> Certificate in Mobile Application Development (CMAD) – ODL mode</strong>
        </li>
    </ul>

    <h3 style="font-size:17px; text-align:left; margin:18px 0 6px 0;">
        <strong>State-of-the-Art Resources</strong>
    </h3>
    <p style="margin:0 0 12px 0;">
        SOCIS integrates multimedia learning materials, online resources, virtual
        labs, and ICT-based teaching methodologies to ensure a comprehensive and
        engaging learning experience.
    </p>

    <h3 style="font-size:17px; text-align:left; margin:18px 0 6px 0;">
       <strong> Global Reach</strong>
    </h3>
    <p style="margin:0 0 15px 0;">
        With its learner-centric approach, SOCIS attracts learners not only from
        India but also from abroad, making it a globally recognised centre for
        computer science education.
    </p>

    <p style="margin:18px 0 0 0; text-align:justify;">
        Through its dynamic and adaptive approach, the <strong>School of Computer
        and Information Sciences (SOCIS)</strong> at IGNOU plays a vital role in
        shaping future-ready professionals and addressing the growing demand for
        skilled IT professionals worldwide.
    </p>

</section></div>
