                                        <div class="tab-pane fade" id="pills-3" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="Objectives"  ><p>
<ul>
<li>To increase both accessibility and acceptability of IGNOU Computer Education Programmes in a coordinated way, ensuring high quality education at various academic levels through well-designed curriculum tuned to the challenging needs of the software industry and  academia;</li>
<li>To disseminate knowledge through an innovative multiple media teaching/learning system.</li>
<li>To follow a multiple entry and multiple exit model for moving though a set of modular courses for a student to achieve her/his goals.</li>
<li>To keep a balance between fundamental concepts, core areas of computer science and specialized skills required while designing curriculum in response to the needs of the market.</li>
<li>To conduct quality research in the emerging areas of Computer Science; and </li>
<li>To provide specific need based computer education and training opportunities for continuous professional development and skill up-gradation to in-service professionals.
</li>
</ul>
</p>

