                                                                        <tr>
                                                                            <th>Brief Profile:</th>
                                                                            <td><p>Prof. Sandeep Singh Rawat is an experienced researcher and consultant with proven leadership abilities in areas of Knowledge Extraction, Information System & Machine Learning, Database, Information Retrieval, Data Warehousing, Big Data and Groups Decision Support Systems.</p><p>Throughout his tenure as an educator, he had the privilege of instructing both graduate and undergraduate students in a wide spectrum of core subjects within the realm of Computer Engineering and Information Technology. Parallel to his extensive teaching background, he has also established a notable research trajectory, extending from India to his international work at Iowa State University, USA. His primary research focus revolves around the domains of Data Mining and Big Data Analytics.</p><p>Dr. Sandeep obtained his Bachelor of Engineering in Computer Science from National Institute of Technology, Surat (formerly REC, Surat), his Masters from Indian Institute of Technology, Roorkee and doctorate degree from University College of Engineering, Osmania University, Hyderabad. Dr. Sandeep was a Research Scholar and Visiting Professor at Iowa State University, USA (2016 to 2018).</p><p>Dr. Sandeep holds membership in several committees at IGNOU, which encompass the Coordination Committee for Online Courses (CCOC), the committee for promoting and supporting Innovation, Entrepreneurship and Startups in the University-IGNOU-IIC 6.0 (2023-2024), the Committee responsible for preparing, uploading, and evaluating bids via GeM for the disposal of outdated IT Infrastructure (e-waste), the Committee tasked with finalizing technical specifications for enhancing Campus Networking and fortifying the Campus Surveillance System, and the Committee dedicated to formulating a Cyber Crisis Management Plan (CCMP) for IGNOU. He is a member of the School Board for various schools of IGNOU and Board of Studies member (2023-2025) at UOU, Haldwani, Uttrakhand.</p><p>Dr. Sandeep is a Senior Member of IEEE and Life Members of Indian Society for Technical Education & Computer Society India and served as Co-Editors of the prestigious Springer AISC (Advances in Intelligent Systems and Computing)and LNNS (Lecture Notes in Networks and Systems) series. He is reviewer and technical committee member for many National / International conferences. He has published/presented high-quality research papers in International, National Journals and proceedings of International Conferences.</p><p>His hobbies include listening to Music, Playing Harmonica, Singing and he is a Hodophile.</p></td>
