                                                                        <tr>
                                                                            <th>Brief Profile:</th>
                                                                            <td><p>Dr. Akshay Kumar is a Professor at the School of Computer and Information Sciences (SOCIS), IGNOU, New Delhi. He received his PhD in Computer and Systems Sciences from the Jawaharlal Nehru University (JNU), New Delhi; Master of Technology (M.Tech.) (Computer Science) from the Indian Institute of Technology (IIT) Delhi and Bachelor of Engineering (B.E.) (Chemical Engineering) from the University of Roorkee (now IIT Roorkee). He is a faculty member in the School of Computer and Information Sciences (SOCIS), IGNOU since 1988, and he has over 37 years of research and teaching experience.</p>
<p>His main research interests are in the areas of Database Management Systems, Big Data Analytics, Data Warehousing and Data Mining, Machine Learning and Data Analysis. He has focused in the last few years on research issues in Machine Learning, Multi-Objective Optimisation, Data Analysis and Big Data Analytics.</p>
<p>He is presently the coordinator of the online Bachelor of Computer Applications programme of IGNOU. He was the Programme Coordinator for PhD in Computer Science, Master of Computer Applications (MCA), Bachelor of Computer Applications (BCA), Advanced Diploma in Information Technology (ADIT) and Certificate in Information Technology (CIT) from time to time.</p>
<p>At IGNOU, he has contributed to curriculum design, course design, courseware development, instructional design, course writing and editing of course materials for various programmes. He has also delivered a large number of live teleconferencing and radio counselling programmes of IGNOU since their inception. He was a resource person / Presenter for More than 30 Interactive Radio Sessions held from time to time on computer science-related topics for MCA/BCA and CIT. He has presented more than 50 Video/Teleconferencing/EDUSAT/video programmes from EMPC Studios for MCA/BCA/BIT/ADIT/ CIT/CIC programmes of SOCIS, IGNOU.<p>
<p>He is a resource person for many training programmes, seminars and workshops. He has delivered many invited talks at various Universities and Institutes and also delivered many lectures to PhD students of various schools of IGNOU in the area of Data Analysis.</p></td>
