ing as Assistant Professor in the School Of Computers and Information Sciences – IGNOU, since 2012. </p><p>One student is awarded PhD (Computer Science) under his supervision and he guiding some more students.</p><p>His research interests include Modelling of Solid-State Devices, Computer Graphics, Digital Image Processing, Pattern Recognition, Machine Learning; and Deep Learning.</p></td>
